Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "ObstacleCollisionScenario" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasObstacle :billboard1 ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :rainy1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:billboard1 a :Billboard ;
    :description "Billboard fallen into the road lane" .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Van parked on the side of the road" .

:rainy1 a :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Imminent collision with fallen billboard in the road" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Imminent collision with fallen billboard in the road
Severity Score: 0.95